            "detailed_description": "<i>Tcheco in the Castle of Lucio</i> is an exciting, fast-paced action game.<br>Help Tcheco the Adventure Boy to leave a mysterious castle full of deadly creatures! <br>Be ready for a big challenge, full of nonsense humor and retro goodness.<br><br><strong>FEATURES:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>2D platform game, perfect for classic Famicom/NES game fans! <br></li><li>Graphics and sounds inspired by 8-bit aesthetics. <br></li><li>Compatible with Xbox gamepad and keyboard. <br></li><li>65 rooms of progressive difficulty. <br></li><li>Easy to learn, simple gameplay.</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "<i>Tcheco in the Castle of Lucio</i> is an exciting, fast-paced action game.<br>Help Tcheco the Adventure Boy to leave a mysterious castle full of deadly creatures! <br>Be ready for a big challenge, full of nonsense humor and retro goodness.<br><br><strong>FEATURES:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>2D platform game, perfect for classic Famicom/NES game fans! <br></li><li>Graphics and sounds inspired by 8-bit aesthetics. <br></li><li>Compatible with Xbox gamepad and keyboard. <br></li><li>65 rooms of progressive difficulty. <br></li><li>Easy to learn, simple gameplay.</li></ul>",
